## 9. 阅读源码的最短路径

按以下顺序即可串起主线：

```text
event_loop_normal / event_loop_overlap
  ↓
get_next_batch_to_run
  ↓
get_new_batch_prefill
  ↓
_get_new_batch_prefill_raw
  ↓
PrefillAdder.add_one_req
  ↓
ScheduleBatch.prepare_for_extend
  ↓
run_batch
  ↓
process_batch_result
```

先只看普通 non-overlap、无 spec、无 disaggregation、无 HiCache 的路径；主干明确后，再逐个打开
chunked prefill、priority、SWA/Mamba、DP attention、PP、speculative decoding 等分支。